  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "feather-meet",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "So the Benefactor sent another one. Look at you: still swaying, like the wind hasn't finished setting you down.",
      "next": "feather-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I'm Falcon. Everyone who lands on this rock ends up in front of me sooner or later. You're early. That's a good sign.",
      "next": "feather-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-3",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "The voice told me to find you. It didn't say why.",
      "next": "feather-4",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-4",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "It never does. Here's the short version: the Layland is big, old and hungry, and right now it would eat you before breakfast. So we fix that.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Then teach me.",
          "next": "feather-5",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-sword"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What is this place?",
          "next": "feather-why",
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 450
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-5",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Good. Meet me at the Training Grounds: the old stone circle, west along the road. We start with the blade.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "later-1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The stone circle, west along the road. I'll be waiting. Try not to fall off anything on the way.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hello",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "So the wind finally brought you. Good.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-why",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Falcon's Landing. An island in the sky, where the Benefactor sends new heroes to learn the three arts before he lets them loose. Blade, bow and light.",
      "next": "feather-4b",
      "options": [],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "feather-4b",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The north's fenced off until you've earned it. Everything you need is on this side.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Then teach me.",
          "next": "feather-5",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "path-of-the-sword"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    }
  ]
